+/*  « Aspect »: the appearance stack of the selected objects of the active
+ *  vector layer (chopgimp-vobject.h), top first:
+ *
+ *    [Ajouter un fond] [Ajouter un contour]
+ *    👁 Contour  [■▾] [∇]  2 px
+ *         Opacité 100 %  Normal ▾
+ *    👁 Fond     [■▾] [∇]
+ *         Opacité  60 %  Produit ▾
+ *    [dupliquer] [supprimer] [monter] [descendre]
+ *
+ *  - the swatch is the color drop-down of the options bar (none, recent
+ *    colors, swatches, patterns, color dialog), ∇ the GIMP gradients
+ *    (linear / radial, reversed);
+ *  - a click on a row makes it the current fill / stroke: the buttons and
+ *    the « Contour » panel act on it;
+ *  - several objects: every change goes to all of them; a fill / stroke
+ *    is « the n-th fill (stroke) from the top » of each object.
+ *
+ *  « Contour »: width, alignment, caps, joins and miter limit, dashes
+ *  (presets or dash / gap lengths), arrowheads, width profile, of the
+ *  current stroke (else the topmost one).
+ *
+ *  One undo step per action, or per burst of changes of one value (a
+ *  spin button held down).  Under CHOPGIMP_NO_VOBJECTS=1 the panels only
+ *  say that the objects are off.
+ */
